                                                "sense_id": "b08383e0-10bf-3aad-81d3-c073bfa7b009",
                                                "text": "I tiptoed into the kitchen, turned on the fluorescent light over the stove, and peered into the oven. It was still warm, though the gas had been turned off. My dinner was there, in a pyrex dish with a cover."
